00:00:06.754 --> 00:00:10.984
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:13.473 --> 00:00:14.506
- I'm very competitive.

00:00:14.506 --> 00:00:16.328
So, if this is like a
competition between me

00:00:16.328 --> 00:00:18.929
and the other Pink Ladies, and the boys,

00:00:18.929 --> 00:00:19.764
I'm gonna win it.

00:00:19.764 --> 00:00:21.424
- I'm really nervous about
this bubble blowing situation.

00:00:21.424 --> 00:00:22.491
