00:00:39.046 --> 00:00:41.506
- I need to find my inner bubble peace.

00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:42.943
- You got to chew it for a long time.

00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:44.161
I'm not quite ready to do it yet.

00:00:47.161 --> 00:00:48.923
(laughing)

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:53.608
(upbeat jazz music)

00:00:56.237 --> 00:00:58.174
